  "promptUsed": "{\"tags\":[\"cel-shaded animation\",\"night scene\",\"motorcycle\",\"residential street\",\"street lamp\"],\"short_caption\":\"A Black man in a black turtleneck stands beside a black motorcycle under a street lamp at night on a quiet residential street.\",\"long_caption\":\"In a cel-shaded animation style, a Black man dressed entirely in a black turtleneck, black trousers, and black boots stands beside a parked black motorcycle. They are positioned on a wet grey asphalt road, directly beneath the white cone of light from a single street lamp. The motorcycle features a round illuminated headlight and a glowing red tail light at the rear. The surrounding environment consists of a quiet residential street at night, with dark silhouettes of trees and low houses lining the horizon. The man's back is to the primary light source, casting his face in shadow while highlighting his shoulders and the top of the motorcycle's fuel tank. A low brick wall and a distant skyscraper silhouette complete the urban residential backdrop.\",\"style_and_atmosphere\":\"The scene is a cel-shaded animation with clean lines and flat color fills. The atmosphere is quiet, urban, and nocturnal, conveyed through the high-contrast lighting and dark color palette.\",\"lighting\":\"A single street lamp overhead provides the primary source of illumination, casting a bright, white, conical spotlight onto the subject. Secondary glows come from the motorcycle's circular headlight and the small red tail light.\",\"key_subjects_and_objects\":\"A Black man with short-cropped hair is the central subject, wearing a form-fitting black turtleneck sweater and black trousers. He stands upright next to the vehicle, with his right hand resting on the fuel tank. The motorcycle is a black cruiser-style bike with spoked wheels, a brown ribbed seat, and a large round headlight. The motorcycle's tail light is a small, bright red circular lamp near the rear license plate bracket. The man's boots are black and sturdy, matching his attire. His posture is calm as he stands on the asphalt road next to the concrete kerb.\",\"environment_and_layout\":\"The setting is a residential street at night, characterized by a grey asphalt road and a concrete sidewalk kerb. A vertical lamp post stands near the motorcycle, extending upward and curving over the street. Behind the road, a low brick wall or fence separates the street from a line of dark green trees and suburban houses. In the far distance, the silhouette of a tall skyscraper rises against the dark blue night sky. The road surface appears slightly reflective, as if recently damp.\",\"visible_progression\":\"no clear progression is visible across the set.\",\"text_and_ocr\":{\"verbatim_strings\":[],\"notes\":\"none\"},\"artifacts_and_overlays\":\"none\"}",
